    "description_implementation_mismatch": "minor",
    "summary": "All tools implement what their descriptions state, but there are numerous undocumented behaviours including flag-injection guards (rejecting inputs starting with '-'), repository confinement via path validation, a global mutex serialising all concurrent tool calls, and merge-state handling in git_commit. These omissions are security-relevant mitigations rather than contradictions of the stated behaviour."
